#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization by configuring IAM, "
"resource groups, and access groups."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk organisasi dengan mengatur IAM, grup "
"sumber daya, dan grup akses."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization"
msgstr "Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk organisasi"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization {#configure-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-for-an-organization}"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk organisasi {#configure-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-for-an-organization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to set up IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk menyiapkan IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Configure IAM settings {#1-configure-iam-settings}"
msgstr "1. Konfigurasi pengaturan IAM {#1-configure-iam-settings}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, configure the following settings in the administrator's IAM account. "
"To review and configure these settings, go to [Manage → IAM → "
"Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, konfigurasi pengaturan berikut di akun IAM administrator. Untuk "
"meninjau dan mengonfigurasi pengaturan ini, buka [Manage → IAM → "
"Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**User list visibility** determines whether users can see each other, "
"regardless of project assignment. The `enabled` setting restricts user "
"visibility. That is, users in your account cannot see each other, even if "
"they can access the same resources. Choose the appropriate value for your "
"environment. See [Controlling user "
"visibility](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-"
"setting) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Visibilitas daftar pengguna** menentukan apakah pengguna bisa saling "
"melihat satu sama lain, terlepas dari penugasan proyek. Pengaturan `enabled`"
" membatasi visibilitas pengguna. Artinya, pengguna di akunmu tidak bisa "
"saling melihat, meskipun mereka bisa mengakses sumber daya yang sama. Pilih "
"nilai yang sesuai untuk lingkunganmu. Lihat [Controlling user "
"visibility](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-"
"setting) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**API key creation** controls whether users can create API keys. In IBM "
"Quantum Platform, it is common to use API keys. If API keys are being used, "
"choose `disabled`. Alternatively, you can give specific permissions to each "
"user.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pembuatan API key** mengontrol apakah pengguna bisa membuat API key. Di "
"IBM Quantum Platform, penggunaan API key adalah hal yang umum. Jika API key "
"digunakan, pilih `disabled`. Atau, Anda bisa memberikan izin khusus kepada "
"setiap pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. (Optional) Create resource groups {#2-optional-create-resource-groups}"
msgstr ""
"2. (Opsional) Buat grup sumber daya {#2-optional-create-resource-groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this step if you are using access groups that directly reference IBM "
"Quantum service instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lewati langkah ini jika Anda menggunakan grup akses yang langsung merujuk ke"
" instans layanan IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you chose to use resource groups, go to [Manage → Account → Resource "
"groups (in Account resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-"
"groups) and click **Create**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memilih untuk menggunakan grup sumber daya, buka [Manage → Account"
" → Resource groups (in Account "
"resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-groups) dan klik "
"**Create**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Create IBM Quantum service instances {#3-create-ibm-quantum-service-"
"instances}"
msgstr ""
"3. Buat instans layanan IBM Quantum {#3-create-ibm-quantum-service-"
"instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you already created IBM Quantum service instances, skip this step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda sudah membuat instans layanan IBM Quantum, lewati langkah ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using resource groups, make sure to create the service instances "
"on the appropriate resource group.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menggunakan grup sumber daya, pastikan untuk membuat instans "
"layanan di grup sumber daya yang sesuai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service instance name, such as `QR-ml`, is needed for access group "
"references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nama instans layanan, seperti `QR-ml`, diperlukan untuk referensi grup "
"akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) for"
" instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah di [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-"
"setup#cloud) untuk petunjuknya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Create access groups for projects {#4-create-access-groups-for-projects}"
msgstr ""
"4. Buat grup akses untuk proyek {#4-create-access-groups-for-projects}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, [create a custom role](/guides/custom-roles#custom) that allows users to perform actions to work with IBM Quantum service instances.\n"
"Next, [create an access group](/guides/access-groups) for each project and give that group the minimum set of permissions that are required to work with the project resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, [buat peran kustom](/guides/custom-roles#custom) yang memungkinkan pengguna melakukan tindakan untuk bekerja dengan instans layanan IBM Quantum.\n"
"Selanjutnya, [buat grup akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk setiap proyek dan berikan grup tersebut kumpulan izin minimum yang diperlukan untuk bekerja dengan sumber daya proyek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Set up your ID provider and assign users {#5-set-up-your-id-provider-and-"
"assign-users}"
msgstr ""
"5. Siapkan penyedia ID-mu dan tetapkan pengguna {#5-set-up-your-id-provider-"
"and-assign-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the appropriate topic, depending on the ID provider you "
"chose to use:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah di topik yang sesuai, tergantung pada penyedia ID yang"
" Anda pilih untuk digunakan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud&reg; as the ID provider for users that have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan IBM Cloud&reg; sebagai penyedia ID untuk pengguna yang memiliki "
"akun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud as the ID provider for users that do not have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan IBM Cloud sebagai penyedia ID untuk pengguna yang tidak memiliki "
"akun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use an ID provider other than IBM Cloud for users that do not have IBM "
"Cloud accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan penyedia ID selain IBM Cloud untuk pengguna yang tidak memiliki "
"akun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Invite users and manage their access](/guides/invite-and-manage-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Undang pengguna dan kelola aksesnya](/guides/invite-and-manage-users)\n"

